a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛丒下第还重过开利寺","author":"邵宝","text":"奔走尘途已半年，扁舟重系寺门前。\n分明记得离家日，古殿寒灯月满天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46564,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭亡儿德孙","author":"邵宝","text":"哭儿泪尽眼将枯，忽忆儿名又误呼。\n灯影隔帘明月落，断肠愁杀树头乌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46565,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和储静夫","author":"邵宝","text":"宦途回首各风烟，浪说春江有渡船。\n珍重寄书千里意，高秋一雁落云边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46566,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"食角黍怀古","author":"邵宝","text":"湘江千里碧连天，绿遍芳洲草似烟。\n餐尽落英人不见，青芦包黍自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46567,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过湖","author":"邵宝","text":"两洲相对五丈许，十里湾湾下湖水。\n借问舟人谁所为，年年水落长如此。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46568,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢巡按使来问疾且惠米","author":"邵宝","text":"藜杖无如病足何，山中书枕两旬多。\n廪人忽致霜台贶，饭罢鱼羹一放歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46569,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观松雪书渊明饮酒诗","author":"邵宝","text":"墨花春洒水晶宫，漫写陶诗岂醉中。\n莫道柴桑非我地，笔端真有晋人风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46570,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉次涯翁老师惠内法酒","author":"邵宝","text":"黄封瓮上又加封，珍赐由来出上供。\n我愿慈颜如此酒，一番春色一番浓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46571,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄莫如山二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"八月风吹汉水槎，江东回首更思家。\n南沙亭上人如玉，赋罢清秋菊有华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46572,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄莫如山二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"亭倚南沙石作山，凤凰巢处竹斑斑。\n执经时有门人到，万卷楼中不闭关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46573,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小舟","author":"邵宝","text":"东海西陲震泽东，杏花雨过藕花风。\n世间多少江湖险，不到蓬窗午梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46574,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客谈竹茶炉二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"松下煎茶试古垆，涛声隐隐起风湖。\n老僧妙思禅机外，烧尽山泉竹未枯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46575,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与客谈竹茶炉二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"彭泽无弦浪抚琴，琅琊山水醉翁心。\n漫将垆火论茶味，云隐松庵午梦深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46576,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谢浦文玉送黄雀及蟹","author":"邵宝","text":"芦花风送稻花香，湖上秋来味故长。\n黄雀能黄蟹能紫，不知何地更鲈乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46577,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中偶成","author":"邵宝","text":"午听浪浪晚未休，萧然六月忽如秋。\n东曹吏散文书静，閒对阶除看水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46578,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为华汝德题画二首 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"小桥南北总春风，多少诗情杖屦中。\n高阁卷帘还坐我，天涯芳草更无穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46579,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为华汝德题画二首 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"山中云起不知山，坐听流泉尽日閒。\n短壑青松凉似水，却疑天上在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46580,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和西涯先生春日书怀二绝 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"游人竞逐赏花辰，却有西堂独卧身。\n江草江花春梦外，题诗聊遣梦中春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46581,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉和西涯先生春日书怀二绝 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"江南春雨慰田家，夏雨如春免踏车。\n梦到江南心亦到，不知春在紫薇花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46582,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云溪卷","author":"邵宝","text":"半为溪水半为云，元是山中一气分。\n莫道无心时出岫，沧浪歌似有心闻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46583,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过冯公岭","author":"邵宝","text":"衣湿才知马入云，隔峰人语半相闻。\n前行共指桃花砦，巨石如碑不见文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46584,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至安仁秦择之来迓","author":"邵宝","text":"沧浪水清濯我缨，隔江如听棹歌声。\n故人相见笑相问，一夜月明三载情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46585,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至广信寄娄诚善 其一","author":"邵宝","text":"二月书来自蔡登，南楼病榻几青灯。\n灵山雨后明如许，渴思令人一夜增。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46586,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将至广信寄娄诚善 其二","author":"邵宝","text":"溪晴数日觉滩多，坐听潺湲和棹歌。\n却到安流山有月，独吟如此晚凉何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46587,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"都昌瞻陶母像","author":"邵宝","text":"穷巷欣来长者车，淹留深愧食无鱼。\n青丝一缕并刀下，挽得中原九鼎馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46588,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊储潭","author":"邵宝","text":"储潭庙前春水深，春云带雨昼阴阴。\n撞钟击鼓礼神去，一十八滩行路心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_2.csv","pointer":46589,"sha256":"ed4816f919f168ab037d2a481a87ac236867458ea2f19effc11ac858978991a3","dynasty":"明"}}]